WIRE.md §4.2, §5.6, DECISIONS 406: case wire names are pairwise distinct within a variant; the later case is E3316 caseWire.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local variant V {
  one @json("w") { n: Int }
  two @json("w") { m: Int }
  three
  four @json("three")
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E3316]  a/a.canon:5:3
  wire "w" of case two is also the wire of case one; give one of them another wire with @json("...")

error[E3316]  a/a.canon:7:3
  wire "three" of case four is also the wire of case three; give one of them another wire with @json("...")

